        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***LARGE 1 BED/1 BATH APARTMENT/ DESIGNATED UNDERGROUND PARKING/ BALCONY / SUPERB LOCATION***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are delighted to present 83 Burnell Court, Northern Cross, Malahide Road, Dublin 17 to the market.\r\n\r\nThis large, bright and spacious apartment is nestled in a vibrant modern and well-maintained development off the Malahide Road.\r\n\r\nConstructed in 2006, Burnell Court is an attractive development in an excellent location for commuters. This apartment is suitable for owner occupiers and investors alike. It boasts secure designated underground parking.\r\n\r\nThe entrance hall leads into a generous open-plan living/dining area and kitchen. This space is flooded with natural light by floor to ceiling windows and glazed-door access to the balcony, a great spot for al fresco dining. The balcony overlooks the communal green space and paved area. The kitchen has tiled floor and splashback and attractive cream cabinetry providing ample storage.\r\n\r\n The bedroom is generously proportioned and features a large window.  There is a fully tiled family bathroom, with bath and overhead shower.\r\n\r\nThere is also a generous storage cupboard that is such an asset to any apartment and will cater for all storage needs.\r\n\r\nBurnell Court is ideally located in Northern Cross close to a host of local shops, restaurants and amenities. Clarehall and Donaghmede Shopping Centres are within a short stroll. There is a choice of bus routes serving the city centre and the property is within close proximity of the M50/M1 motorways and Dublin Airport. The property also enjoys easy access to the coastal towns of Malahide, Portmarnock and Howth.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
